0,North Frisian language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Frisian_language,"North Frisian is a minority language of Germany, spoken by about 10,000 people in North Frisia.[2] The language is part of the larger group of the West Germanic Frisian languages. The language comprises 10 dialects which are themselves divided into an insular and a mainland group.","Frisian, Northern",Indo-European
